      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This armor-plated creature is related to the bulette except what it lacks in spines, it makes up in armor.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 25, touch 11; flat-footed 23 (+2 dex, +14 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 147 [196] (14d8+84)</p><p>Fort +14, Ref +11, Will +7</p><p>DR 5/cold-iron; Resist Earth 15</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 30 ft.</p><p>Melee 2 Claws +16 (1d8+7), Bite +17 (2d6+10/19-20)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Leap, Savage Bite</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 24, Dex 15, Con 20, Int 2, Wis 13, Cha 6</p><p>Base Atk +10; CMB +18; CMD 30 (34 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Cleave, Improved Initiative, Iron Will, Power Attack, Skill Focus (Perception), Toughness, Weapon Focus (Bite)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +11 (+19 jumping), Perception +13, Racial Modifiers +8 on Acrobatics checks made to jump</p>"
